        "id": 5230
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-20T20:20:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Discussed off-line. Currently, Graphite will draw an SkPath w/ a circle in it differently than a drawCircle call. Changing this behavior is a topic of discussion w/in the larger Skia team.\n\nWrt kPaths vs kSimple drawTypes, we\u0027ve resolved to fuse them together into a kShape drawType.",
      "parentUuid": "4f0c089b_e9d79863",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 45,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 45,
        "endChar": 34
      },
      "revId": "cb2970ae5b3d8316521831ca55d027683ad0572a",
